OL,3,GNEWSARail services restored after
OL,4,Aleaves disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FRail services in East Yorkshire have
OL,7,Freturned to normal after some trains
OL,8,Fdid not stop at stations due to
OL,9,F"slippery" leaves on the tracks.
OL,11,FThe cancelled stops by Northern were
OL,12,Fcriticised by local MPs, who wrote to
OL,13,Fthe company asking what was being done
OL,14,Fto deal with the problem.
OL,16,FHull North and Cottingham MP Dame Diana
OL,17,FJohnson had said the annual autumn fall
OL,18,Fof leaves was "clearly not a new
OL,19,Fproblem for the rail industry".
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,384,380,200,160,0,100
