OL,3,GNEWSARail services restored after
OL,4,Aleaves disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn response, Northern apologised for
OL,7,Fthe disruption and said more than #17m
OL,8,Fwas spent in the region each year by
OL,9,FNetwork Rail on "vegetation
OL,10,Fmanagement". It added: "Unfortunately,
OL,11,Fdespite these efforts we can't yet
OL,12,Fcompletely eradicate the issue."
